    special: "Special changes depending on current character: [Shanks] Applies \"Territory: Slasher class\" to the field (boosts crew's ATK up to 1.5x and reduces damage taken up to 25% based on number of characters matching the territory) for 3 turns, reduces Slasher characters' Special charge time by 1 turn, and boosts damage dealt to delayed or Weakened enemies up to 3x based on outcome of Action Special (2.5x for MISS, 2.7x for GOOD, 2.8x for GREAT, 2.9x for PERFECT, 3.0 for EXCELLENT) for 2 turns. If 6 Slasher characters are on the crew, allows crew to stack up to 2 different damage boosting effects (cannot stack the damage boost of the same type) for 3 turns. If 2 different damage boosting effects can be stacked when Special is launched, boosts damage dealt to enemies affected by DEF Down and increase damage taken status by 2.5x for 1 turn, and further increases crew's damage dealt to enemies with a specific status effect boost effect by +0.25 (effect applies to damage dealt to enemies with a specific status effect boost effect from this Special) [Kid] [This Special can only be used 1 time during a quest and can charge Special charge over its MAX (including Special charge time reduction effects)] Applies Paralysis (75% chance not to reduce action turns) to all enemies for 2 turns ignoring immunity to all status effects, increases crew's multiplicative chain multiplier boost<hidden> (except additive boosts)</hidden> to 2x, boosts the chain multplier by 1.5x for 1 turn (plus a further +0.1 every 3 turns over MAX Special, up to 2.5x), boosts damage dealt to enemies affected by Paralysis by 2.5x for 1 turn (plus a further +0.1 every 3 turns over MAX Special, up to 3.5x), cuts crew's HP by 50% (plus a further 5% every 1 turn over MAX Special, up to 99%), but deals 200x the HP lost in non-type damage to all enemies, reduces all enemies' [방어력 상승][데미지 감소] duration by 6 turns, reduces duration a further 4 turns if 6 Shooter characters on the crew, and if crew's HP is 20% or below, applies [데미지 무효] status until hit 1 time <hidden>(effect is also applied if HP becomes 20% or below with this Special)</hidden>",
