      character2: "Activates HP Guard of 100% effect for 2 turns, changes Shooter characters' slots (including [BLOCK] slots) to [TND], and changes crew's ATK multiplier of [TND][BOMB][S. BOMB] slots to 2.5x when slots match<hidden> (normally 2.0x when matching)</hidden>, 0.5x when unfavorable, 1.0x otherwise) for 2 turns"
